// LD mode (round 3, owner: "LegenDoom's non-gun sounds: a toggle in BD22 VR's options"). LegenDoom 3.0 loads before
// BD22 VR, so these definitions win: LegenDoom's legendary pickup jingles and the legendary-monster aura are silent here
// and BD22 VR's LD mode plays LegenDoom's own lumps itself (rsld/ld/*, zscript/rsld/ldsounds.zs), unless the option
// "Mute LegenDoom Pickup & Aura Sounds" (rsld_mute_ld_sounds) is on. Without LegenDoom these names are never played
// and the lumps below do not exist (no sound). dsempty: the engine's silent lump (qzdoom.pk3 sounds/dsempty.lmp).
effects/newlegendarypickup1		dsempty
effects/newlegendarypickup2		dsempty
effects/newlegendarypickup3		dsempty
effects/epicnewlegendarypickup		dsempty
effects/agitatingpickup			dsempty
effects/mysteriouspickup		dsempty
effects/seriouspickup			dsempty
effects/desperatepickup			dsempty
effects/augmentedpickup			dsempty
effects/beampickup			dsempty
effects/illegalpickup			dsempty
effects/legendaryenemyloop		dsempty
effects/legendaryenemy			dsempty
effects/legendaryenemyboss		dsempty
// round 4: LegenDoom's info screen open / close (LEGENDMEN.acs LocalAmbientSound): played by the LD mode (ldsounds.zs InfoTick)
menu/infoopen				dsempty
menu/infoclose				dsempty

// LegenDoom's own lumps (LegenDoom 3.0 SNDINFO:286-306), played by the LD mode
rsld/ld/newlegendarypickup1		LDLEGEN1
rsld/ld/newlegendarypickup2		LDLEGEN2
rsld/ld/newlegendarypickup3		LDLEGEN3
$random rsld/ld/newlegendarypickup { rsld/ld/newlegendarypickup1 rsld/ld/newlegendarypickup2 rsld/ld/newlegendarypickup3 }
rsld/ld/epicnewlegendarypickup		LDLEGENE
rsld/ld/agitatingpickup			LDAGITAT
rsld/ld/mysteriouspickup		LDMYSTER
rsld/ld/seriouspickup			LDSERIOU
rsld/ld/desperatepickup			LDDESPER
rsld/ld/augmentedpickup			LDAUGMEN
rsld/ld/beampickup			LDBEAMPK
rsld/ld/illegalpickup			LDILLEGA
rsld/ld/legendaryenemyloop		LDLELOOP
rsld/ld/legendaryenemy			LDLETRAN
$limit rsld/ld/legendaryenemy		0
rsld/ld/legendaryenemyboss		LDLEBOSS
$limit rsld/ld/legendaryenemyboss	0
rsld/ld/infoopen			LDINFO1
rsld/ld/infoclose			LDINFO2

// round 4: QuestZDoom's own menu sounds (its filter/game-doomchex/sndinfo.txt:439-447), played in place of LegenDoom's
// LDMENU* by the menu delegate (ldsounds.zs RSLD_MenuDelegate) while "Mute LegenDoom Sounds" is on
rsld/qz/activate			dsswtchn
rsld/qz/backup				dsswtchn
rsld/qz/prompt				dsswtchn
rsld/qz/cursor				dspstop
rsld/qz/change				dsstnmov
rsld/qz/invalid				dsoof
rsld/qz/dismiss				dsswtchx
rsld/qz/choose				dspistol
rsld/qz/clear				dsswtchx
